XamUserReadProfileSettings reports an unset title-specific setting with source 1 (default) instead of 0, and a stored
empty title binary the same way. The title (TMNT) treats any source other than 1 as "profile data present", so the
source 0 made a never-written 0x63E83FFF profile blob look valid: the zero-filled blob then supplied music and
sound-effect volumes of 0 and the game muted everything at the first Start press. A stored title setting still reports 2,
so an intentional volume of 0 is kept.

